flowchart TD
    A([Finding or Recommendation Detected]) --> B[Remediation Agent: Draft Plan]
    B --> C{Risk Tier Assessment}

    C -->|Low Risk| D[Single Approver Required]
    C -->|Medium Risk| E[Single Approver + Change Window]
    C -->|High Risk| F[Two Approvers Required]
    C -->|Critical Risk| G[Two Approvers + CISO + Change Board]

    D --> H[Submit to Approval Queue]
    E --> H
    F --> H
    G --> H

    H --> I{Approver Decision}

    I -->|Approve| J[Schedule for Change Window]
    I -->|Reject| K([Workflow Closed — Reason Logged])
    I -->|Modify| L[Edit Steps] --> H
    I -->|No Response in SLA| M[Escalate to CloudOps Lead] --> I

    J --> N[Pre-Execution: Capture Before-State]
    N --> O[Execute Step 1]
    O --> P{Step Successful?}

    P -->|Yes| Q[Execute Next Step]
    P -->|No| R[Automatic Rollback Triggered]

    Q --> S{All Steps Complete?}
    S -->|No| O
    S -->|Yes| T[Post-Execution Verification]

    T --> U{Finding Resolved?}
    U -->|Yes| V[Mark Remediation Complete]
    U -->|No| W{Side Effects Detected?}

    W -->|Yes| R
    W -->|No| X[Flag for Manual Review]

    R --> Y[Execute Rollback Plan]
    Y --> Z{Rollback Successful?}
    Z -->|Yes| AA[Create Incident — Notify Team]
    Z -->|No| AB[CRITICAL: Manual Intervention Required]

    V --> AC[Write Audit Log Entry]
    AC --> AD[Update Finding Status]
    AD --> AE([Remediation Complete])

    style R fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style AB fill:#c0392b,color:#fff
    style AE fill:#27ae60,color:#fff
    style K fill:#95a5a6,color:#fff
